1
00:00:00,521 --> 00:00:04,361
Yeah, I'm pulling out all the stops.
There's a 39.95 Lover's Special...

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:05,905
(Howard:)...at P.F. Chang's.

3
00:00:07,028 --> 00:00:09,198
Yeah, egg rolls, dumplings,
bottomless wok.

4
00:00:09,363 --> 00:00:13,243
Yeah, and you get your picture taken
on the big marble horse out front.

5
00:00:13,409 --> 00:00:14,949
(Sheldon:)Given that Saint Valentine...

6
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:18,709
(Sheldon:)...was a third century Roman priest
who was stoned and beheaded...

7
00:00:18,873 --> 00:00:21,123
(Sheldon:)...wouldn't a more appropriate
celebration...

8
00:00:21,292 --> 00:00:24,792
(Sheldon:)...be taking one's steady gal
to witness a brutal murder?

9
00:00:25,838 --> 00:00:28,218
(Howard:)I understand your point,
but given the choice...

10
00:00:28,382 --> 00:00:30,552
(Howard:)...Jews always go with Chinese food.

11
00:00:31,969 --> 00:00:35,059
(Raj:)If anyone's interested,
I'll be spending this Valentine's Day...

12
00:00:35,223 --> 00:00:37,263
(Raj:)...the same way
I spend every Valentine's.

13
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:40,813
Buying rotisserie chicken,
taking it home, standing over the sink...

14
00:00:40,978 --> 00:00:44,858
(Raj:)...and eating it out of the package
with my bare hands like an animal.

15
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,820
Okay, so to sum up,
one giant marble horse...

16
00:00:48,986 --> 00:00:52,946
...one asinine comment,
one lonely man and his chicken...

17
00:00:53,116 --> 00:00:54,786
...and let's see. Who's left?

18
00:00:54,951 --> 00:01:00,021
Oh, that's right, my plans.

